      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Create a <code>MachineConfig</code> object that identifies the kernel argument. The following example shows a kernel argument for an Intel CPU.
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: machineconfiguration.openshift.io/v1\nkind: MachineConfig\nmetadata:\n  labels:\n    machineconfiguration.openshift.io/role: worker\n  name: 100-worker-iommu\nspec:\n  config:\n    ignition:\n      version: 3.2.0\n  kernelArguments:\n      - intel_iommu=on\n# ..."} lang="yaml" />
      <ul>
